					<td><a href="img/noj2_012.jpg">
					<img height="283" src="img/noj2_012_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/ntc/nature_of_japan/noj2/img/noj2_012.jpg" --></a></td>
				</tr>		
				<tr>
					<td class="comment" colspan="2">原型製作：平田隆行<br />
